    "created_at": "2015-09-01T18:01:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-01T18:01:17Z",
    "body": "Applet doesn't function because we disallow the creation of the underlying control, but the element and type still exist. We block all but a fixed set of CLSID's. This is no different than it has been in the past. However, we are also willing to remove the element entirely. My main concerns are with parsing semantics. We want to ensure that when we remove the element itself, that the parser still does the correct thing. We had issues with BGSOUND when we removed it that come to mind.\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
