    "created_at": "2015-09-02T13:00:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-09-02T13:00:02Z",
    "body": "Overall usage of `<applet>` is very low, but it should be possible to measure how often the parser bits actually make a difference if one wanted to remove `<applet>` fully. But leaving the parser as-is also seems fine to me.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
